{"unit_id":"sanqiPanax__jieyaTool#card-zh","repo":"sanqiPanax/jieyaTool","commit":"09fd3cb4cb7287b4ebd089f7f972da6ac2e76813","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-extract 是一个面向 DSH Agent 的批量解压工具插件，通过三个模型工具接入：单文件格式探测、目录批量解压和环境检查。它按文件头识别压缩格式，递归处理嵌套压缩包，并可尝试全局及从解压内容中发现的密码；还会识别 SFX 与分卷附属卷。解压结果写入源目录旁的 _extracted 目录，可指定密码文件、输出目录和递归深度。适合需要整理一批后缀混乱、层级嵌套或带密码归档文件的 DSH 用户。运行需要本机安装 7-Zip，也可用 SEVENZIP_PATH 指定程序位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:34","lib/index.js:71","lib/archive-core.js:13","lib/archive-core.js:232"]}
{"unit_id":"sanqiPanax__jieyaTool#card-en","repo":"sanqiPanax/jieyaTool","commit":"09fd3cb4cb7287b4ebd089f7f972da6ac2e76813","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-auto-extract adds DSH tools to identify archive formats, recursively extract nested files, and check the environment. It tries supplied or discovered passwords and handles SFX and split volumes. Output goes to _extracted; local 7-Zip is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:34","lib/index.js:71","lib/archive-core.js:13","lib/archive-core.js:232"]}
