{"unit_id":"sanqiPanax__jieyaTool#feature-format","repo":"sanqiPanax/jieyaTool","commit":"09fd3cb4cb7287b4ebd089f7f972da6ac2e76813","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-extract 的功能「格式探测」：可按文件头识别 7z、RAR、ZIP、GZip、XZ 等格式，不依赖文件扩展名；对 exe 使用 7-Zip 探测自解压归档，并排除普通程序。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/archive-core.js:49"]}
